    "body": "Quick pass (orchestrating session): the review-fix round is pushed (head f74f878d); the branch merged main and is MERGEABLE / CLEAN, so `conflicts` is dropped; the author's full quick gate (sim, motion, app, ui) and clippy on sim, app and motion were green on the merged tree. Flagged ready for a re-review; `needs-rework` stays until that review replaces it. Note for the reviewer: this round also changes the mid-turn sweep for tools WITHOUT a body (a stock-only shank hit no longer switches the sweep off, so a part hit on the same move is reported) - it can only add part warnings. This PR changes collision verdicts and is under the safety floor: a high-tier review is owed before merge.",
